spice
* SPICE netlist for the schematic
V1 1 2 DC <value_of_V1>
G1 3 2 1 2 <value_of_gm> ; Controlled current source g_m V_1
RO 3 2 <value_of_rO>
RD 3 2 <value_of_RD>
VX 3 2 DC <value_of_VX>

* Nodes:
* 1: Positive terminal of V1
* 2: Ground node
* 3: Common node for current source, RO, RD and positive terminal of VX

.END